July 1, 2022 is the 25th anniversary of Hong Kong's return to China and the inauguration of the governor of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region for the sixth term.
At the ceremony, Chinese President Xi Jinping expressed his greetings, greetings and thanksgiving, emphasizing that the basic object of "one country, two systems" is to support democracy, security, national development interests under this area, Hong Kong and Macau has a high degree of autonomy. The next five years are a key period for Hong Kong to open up a new future and jump higher. How to seize this opportunity?
Since returning home, Hong Kong has been a special administrative region of China under the direct control of the Chinese central government under the Chinese national governance system. In his July 1 speech, Chinese President Xi Jinping stressed the need to "patriot Hong Kong". There is no people in any country or region in the world that allows a force or a person who is not patriotic to betray the nation to come to power.
The basic development of Hong Kong and the golden key to solving all kinds of problems in Hong Kong as well. During his stay in Hong Kong, Xi Jinping inspected the work at the Hong Kong Science Park, especially to show strong support for technological innovations. Contributing to the situation in China, Hong Kong will continue to write new development stories and new prosperity.
