Two mobile phones were seized and handed over to the authorities in Po Sen Chey district
(Phnom Penh): A female transporter was sitting on a motorbike dialing a mobile phone when a suspect on a motorbike approached and shocked the woman with two mobile phones, but the victim escaped. Shouting that the thieves, the suspect immediately escaped on a motorcycle, unfortunately fell and was caught by relatives and victims and sent to the authorities for legal action.
Authorities said on July 5, 2022 that the above case occurred at 3:30 on July 4, 2022 at the point of the concrete road, Kork Chambok village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Police confirmed that the story before the incident, the victim was sitting on the motorcycle on the motorcycle on the corner of Duong Ngiep Road, then suddenly the suspect was riding a motorcycle alone from Chom Chao Road. Arriving at the scene, the suspect saw the victim was sitting alone dialing the phone and there was a quiet situation, then the suspect rode a motorcycle next to the victim and acted to shock the victim from two phones. .
After the incident, the suspect on a motorcycle escaped about 10 meters, the suspect hit the victim's brother on a motorcycle, causing the motorcycle to fall, while the suspect was arrested by the victim and his brother and handed over to the police. The first chief took legal action.
The police continued that in front of the police, the suspect confessed that he actually shocked the victim's mobile phone. Currently, the above suspects were sent by the 1st Chao Chao Police Force to the Criminal Division of the Por Sen Chey District Inspectorate to build a case according to legal procedures.
Preah Vihear Province Sangkum Thmey Assistance Team Calls on Citizens to Keep the Peace and Oppose Anyone Who Wants to Destroy the Peace
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Chan Nonvitya, Chairman of the Central Working Group for Sangkum Thmei District, Preah Vihear Province, and Mr. Samleang Try, Permanent Member of the CPP Committee of Preah Vihear Province and Chairman of the Provincial Task Force for Sangkum Thmei District, this morning. On July 05, 2022, led about 500 members of the Cambodian People's Party to celebrate the 71st anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party (June 28, 1951 - June 28, 2022).
On that occasion, Mr. VA Setha, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party, Sangkum Thmey District, read out the full speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the 71st Anniversary Commemoration Ceremony for about 500 members, giving a brief history of the arrest. The founding of the Cambodian People's Party was on June 28, 1951, with the original name "Khmer Revolutionary People's Party", then in 1991 changed its name to "Cambodian People's Party".
He added that the CPP has achieved great success in the peace process through the implementation of a win-win policy that completely ended the protracted civil war and established peace throughout the country.
Separately, Mr. Sam Leang Try, Chairman of the Provincial Working Group for Sangkum Thmey District, expressed his deep gratitude to the people of Sangkum Thmey District who love to trust the CPP, love Samdech Techo Hun Sen to vote for the CPP to make the party win. Flooding on the occasion of the recent 5th Commune / Sangkat Council Election.
He also mentioned the local development projects in Preah Vihear province in the future under the leadership of Mr. Meas Sophea, Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group on Preah Vihear Province and Mr. Prak Sovann, Provincial Governor in the common interest. .
Mr. Samleang Try reaffirmed to the members that the Cambodian People's Party, under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party, is committed to building, defending and developing the nation. Continuous growth to meet the needs of the people in the 2018-2023 mandate and achieve development goals in all areas with efficiency, equity and sustainability.
(Phnom Penh): As an architectural structure in the ninth century with the amazing style of the Khmer architects standing on the top of Phnom Dangrek, the temple of Preah Vihear has shown a powerful appearance from the glorious Angkorian period to the present.
Under the Royal Crusade of His Majesty the King and the talented leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, the Temple of Preah Vihear was inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List on July 7, 2008.
