(Phnom Penh): As the Special Envoy of the ASEAN Chair on Myanmar, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, concluded his second working visit to the Republic of the Union of Myanmar from June 29 to 30. July 3, 2022.
