Riverside in Prey Khlong village, Rokat commune and Riverside in Prek 3 village, Samrong commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province.
Pursat Provincial Police Facebook page said on July 1, 2022 that after receiving the opinion of the Provincial Police Commissioner, the Phnom Kravanh District Intervention Force, in cooperation with the Leach Administrative Police Station, arrested 9 male and female students. People came in for questioning after they smoked e-cigarettes.
