BEIJING, July 1 (Xinhua) - A ceremony to mark the 25th anniversary of Hong Kong's return to China and the appointment of the sixth administration of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (SAR) opened in Hong Kong on the morning of July 1. Xi Jinping, General Secretary of the CPC Central Committee and chairman of the CPC Central Military Commission, delivered a keynote speech.
Xi Jinping said that more than 5,000 years of Chinese civilization history records the efforts of Chinese ancestors in Lingnan. The modern history of China after the Opium War records the humiliation of Hong Kong forcible secession and also records the struggle of the Chinese dynasty for national liberation.
The great century-old history of struggle of the Chinese Communist Party records the special and important contributions made by the Hong Kong people. Throughout the centuries, the people of Hong Kong have mourned with their homeland and have always been connected by blood.
BEIJING, June 30 (Xinhua) - Chinese President Xi Jinping, accompanied by Governor of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Carrie Lam, arrived at the Hong Kong Science Park on Friday to exchange views and exchange views with Chinese Premier Wen Jiabao. Of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and the Chinese Academy of Engineering, and scientific researchers and representatives of innovative and young technology enterprises in Hong Kong.
Hong Kong Science Park is the largest scientific and technical research and incubator in Hong Kong. Today, the park has more than 1,100 companies and more than 17,000 scientific and technical researchers who have attracted many well-known local and foreign scientific research institutes to set up laboratories.
In the Science Park Gallery, Xi Jinping gave a briefing on the development of science and technology and innovation in Hong Kong, the interaction of innovation and technology development in Shenzhen and Hong Kong, and the development of the Hong Kong Science Park. Visit the Hong Kong Innovation and Technology Enterprise Exhibition.
Afterwards, Xi Jinping had a cordial conversation with academics, researchers, representatives of innovative enterprises and young technologies. He stressed that China attaches great importance to innovation, science and technology and deeply implements innovative development-driven development strategies.
Xi Jinping said that young people are the most vibrant and innovative group of people in the whole society and also a new force in promoting the development of innovation and technology. Provide more development space for young people and support young people to achieve their dreams of innovation and entrepreneurship in a life of struggle.
