* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on July 9, the King will plant saplings in Battambang province to celebrate Tree Day after a two-year absence due to the Kovid 19 pandemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that through his assistant, many long-standing land disputes in Banteay Meanchey province have been resolved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that before the deep water, there were more fish, less people, but now the shallow water, less fish, more people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if there is a human race, it is necessary to recognize the situation of this change.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his frustration with those who raised the issue of deforestation. Samdech Techo said that the loss of forests due to the increase in population and the need for housing and cultivation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges the release of juveniles into rivers and lakes to increase fish production, and fish farming must also be promoted to meet the needs of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to remind the provincial governors around the Tonle Sap Lake to clearly implement the demarcation of the Tonle Sap Conservation Area for the people who have occupied it for many years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people of Tonle Sap Lake not to encroach on the protected lands in areas 2 and 3.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth to put a demining budget in the national budget and gradually declare a mine-free zone.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the participation of the private sector in demining in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people who voted for the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the election of the people in support of the Cambodian People's Party is an election for peace and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his hope that the people will continue to vote for the Cambodian People's Party in 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace must be maintained, there is no need to lose peace before trying to regain it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends that the project to repair flood-damaged bridges in Banteay Meanchey province be included in the budget for the Ministry of Rural Development in 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that on June 30, 19 cases of 19 cases of Kovid were found.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on people to be vaccinated against Kovid 19 and even after the 20th dose is not charged.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen forbids the arrest of a person who falsified information about the death of Kovid 19 with the Candlelight Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterates that the Kovid 19 vaccine in Cambodia does not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, political affiliation or color.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks for the understanding of the people on the increase in fuel prices because it is a global problem. Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks people to use electric cars instead of fuel cars.
