(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) on June 30, 2022 issued a press release on the date of the 7th National Assembly Election 2023.
According to a press release obtained by Fresh News on June 30, the date for the 7th National Assembly election is set for Sunday, July 23, 2023.
Khmer citizens who are on the official voter list in 2022 are the voters for the 7th National Assembly election in 2023.
