At the same time, in order to promote the use of tourism books in general education more effectively, Minister Thong Khon also proposed three points, such as:
First, request the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports to continue to promote and guide the use of this 11th grade textbook to general education schools under the auspices of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, as well as continue to provide support and cooperation on compilation. And prepare 12th grade tourism textbooks and prepare tourism skills curriculum for inclusion in other general education levels.
Second, request all educational and training institutions under the Ministry of Education to continue to promote training on tourism and hospitality skills, both at the skill level and in tourism and hospitality management, especially for untrained education and training institutions. Tourism Skills Please organize tourism skills classes, especially in tourist destinations that do not have tourism skills training schools.
