On that occasion, Minister Pan Sosak praised the role of the ASEAN Business Advisory Council and the participation of the private sector, especially micro and small enterprises in the development and economic transformation of ASEAN, which has contributed to ASEAN economic integration. Significant progress over the past decade.
Minister Pan Sosak informed that Cambodia, as the rotating chair of ASEAN in 2022, will promote and accelerate the rehabilitation of all sectors to build an ASEAN Economic Community with sustainability, environment and resilience in accordance with the theme "ASEAN A.C.T. "Face together."
