The ASEAN Business and Investment Summit and the ASEAN Business Awards will be held in November 2022, coinciding with the 41st ASEAN Summit hosted by Cambodia.
Neak Oknha Kith Meng announces the organization of the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit 2022 and the ASEAN Business Award 2022
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, in collaboration with the ASEAN Business Advisory Council, held an official announcement ceremony on “Organizing the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit 2022 and the ASEAN Business Awards 2022” under the chairmanship of Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister. Ministry of Commerce and Minister of Economy of ASEAN on June 29, 2022.
The event was also attended by more than 150 ambassadors from ASEAN member countries and ASEAN partner countries, the ASEAN Business Advisory Council, the Capital-Provincial Chamber of Commerce, the International Chamber of Commerce, the Trade Association, development partners and representatives of relevant ministries and institutions.
Speaking on the occasion of the official announcement ceremony, Duke Kith Meng stressed the importance of organizing the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit and the ASEAN Business Awards to be held in November 2022, coinciding with the summit. ASEAN, hosted by Cambodia.
The duke emphasized that both events were influential regional events and always supported by ASEAN and world leaders. In 2022, the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit will be held for two days, on the first day, the ASEAN Business Awards will be presented to the best companies that have won the ASEAN Awards.
On the second day, there will be discussions on key topics, including keynote speeches and interventions of ASEAN leaders and ASEAN partners, which will discuss and discuss economic recovery, trade and investment promotion through the Agreement. As an economic partner in all areas, digital technology and sustainable development.
The President requested the support of all stakeholders, both technical and financial, for the successful organization of the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit and the 2022 ASEAN Business Awards and proud results. .
The President informed the whole ceremony that the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and the ASEAN Business Advisory Council are very pleased and honored to receive the message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in support of the meeting. ASEAN Business and Investment Summit 2022.
In addition, there is a letter of support from Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce and ASEAN Economic Minister for Cambodia for the organization of the ASEAN Business and Investment Summit 2022.
The ASEAN Business Advisory Council was established in 2001 by the ASEAN Heads of State / Government with the primary task of providing input and private sector recommendations to help drive ASEAN's efforts towards economic integration.
