"Of course, I would like to see the presence of the third phase of the DEY program, because I firmly believe that the DEY program really responds and contributes to Cambodia's economic growth and prosperity," he said.
As a result of the 4th meeting of the Board of Directors, it was achieved: * Approve the prioritization of the second phase of the program. * Approve the strategic communication plan. * Discuss for the first time the next phase of the program, which is the third phase.
