The Special Envoy's second visit to Myanmar aims to monitor the progress of the implementation of the five-point consensus and the outcome of the ASEAN Humanitarian Assistance Consultation Meeting for Myanmar held last month, the Foreign Ministry said. May 6, 2022 in Phnom Penh and to contribute to the creation of a conducive environment for the conduct of an environmental political dialogue through meetings with all stakeholders.
