"We all share the view that peaceful reconciliation is not possible when one side of the conflict is not included in the solution equation," said the Special Envoy of the ASEAN Chair. "Therefore, all ASEAN colleagues strongly urge the State Council of Myanmar to launch a process of national reconciliation without further delay," he said.
The special envoy added that a peaceful political solution to a conflict, no matter how complex, requires a political space shared by all parties involved.
