(Phnom Penh): On the morning of June 28, 2022, General Vong Veasna, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), received a delegation from the Vietnam People's Army Combat Commission led by Brigadier General Tran Hong Kong, Deputy Commissioner General. Discuss work at the General Command.
