* June 28, 2022 is the 71st anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party, originally known as the Khmer Revolutionary People's Party, originated from the patriotic movement of the Cambodian people against the colonialists for national independence. .
* Since its inception, the Cambodian People's Party has maintained its identity as a people's party, dependent on the people and for the people to overcome all obstacles at all stages to achieve great historical achievements with deep meaning. Best for the stability, prosperity and prosperity of the motherland of Cambodia.
This is what makes people love, trust and vote for the party to lead the country forever, both at the national and sub-national levels.
