The following is the announcement of the NEC: Duke Ly Samet took the people of Srekor commune, Sesan district to visit Sihanoukville as a thank you for supporting the Cambodian People's Party
(Preah Sihanouk): Duke Ly Samet, Advisor to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and his team took about 550 people in Srekor commune, Sesan district, Stung Treng province to visit and see the achievements in Preah Sihanouk province. .
A happy trip to the southwest coast of Srekor commune was made as a token of gratitude to the people of Srekor commune and to vote for the Cambodian People's Party to control the commune council seats in This 5th Mandate Council / Commune / Sangkat Election Event.
In the last commune / sangkat council election in Srekor commune, the CPP lost the commune chief seat because at that time, the people expressed some resentment with the authorities, especially regarding the construction of the Lower Sesan 2 hydropower project.
Duke Ly Samet's team also promised to take them to the sea in Sihanoukville if the CPP wins the election in Srekor commune.
As a result, the people of Srekor commune voted for the Cambodian People's Party to control all commune council seats in Srekor commune on June 5. In accordance with the contract and as an opportunity for the people of the Northeast to enjoy the sea according to their wishes, on June 25, Duke Ly Samet and his team organized this trip for them. By covering travel, food and accommodation as well.
The people of Srekor commune thanked the team of Duke Ly Samet for making their wish come true to visit and know the sea. With a fun and intimate trip, the people of Srekor commune have expressed their admiration for the progress in Sihanoukville, a great achievement born of the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and President of the People's Party. Cambodians.
The people of Srekor commune, who used to be at odds with the authorities and the Cambodian People's Party in the past, have declared their support for the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party and will always follow the path of the Cambodian People's Party.
