At the same time, Green Farm has sufficient capacity to establish an organic fertilizer factory, which is currently preparing to build a complete organic fertilizer plant with zero and zero water, as well as natural pesticides. Preparation of organic fertilizers and pesticides is registered commercially and has the right technical production experts from Israel.
