This machine is a machine that the General Department of Immigration received under the support of the Royal Government and the people of Japan through the security section of the Embassy of Japan in Cambodia to be used to control and prevent the trafficking of illegal weapons, drugs and narcotics to contribute. Maintain security, order and national security, especially for the 40th ASEAN Summit in 2022, which Cambodia is hosting.
The Bavet International Border Crossing Police Station is an international border gateway that has made a significant contribution to the national economy, which is connected to the Mok Bai border crossing in Tay Ninh province, Vietnam. Also to serve the transport sector and tourists passing through both countries.
