The provincial governor further advised that the joint authorities in all districts led by the District Unity Command must continue to operate on a regular basis, to crack down on fishing offenses during the closed fishing season as well as the open fishing season, and must take measures to crack down on all fishing offenses. In each of its districts without allowing any illegal fishing to continue.
