The district chief continued that every day, the crackdown on fishing crimes took place every day, both in the open and closed seasons. Understand the business: Federation of Automobile Industry of Cambodia that the establishment of more new car assembly plants will help the price of cars can be better than imported cars
(Phnom Penh): So far, no less than 7 car assembly companies are operating new car assembly operations in Cambodia.
The increase in the number of car assembly plants is seen by the Automobile Federation of Cambodia (CAIF) as helping to increase Cambodia's domestic production, increase employment for the people, and help them earn a better income, especially as car prices may be better than cars. Import.
Speaking to Fresh News, Mr. Soeun Dara confirmed that some car companies have started to open car assembly plants in Cambodia, observing the opportunities of Cambodia with the leadership of the Royal Government and the Cambodian economy is growing well.
In particular, through the government's policy to develop itself into a high middle income country by 2030, the confidence of investors in Cambodia and the growth of new car use in Cambodia has increased. It will increase sharply in 2022 compared to five years ago. This is the additional confirmation of Mr. Soeun Dara.
Mr. Soeun Dara said that the price of cars will be better than cars imported from abroad because the tax is lower than the import of cars as a whole.
However, he said that the tax can be reduced as long as the Royal Government facilitates the tax on auto parts imported into Cambodia by providing tax incentives or reducing taxes related to spare parts and components. Make the car more affordable.
"If we have more assembly plants in Cambodia, but if we continue to import 100 percent of the parts as we do now, it will not be very cheap," said Soeun Dara.
At the same time, the CEO said that Cambodia needs to attract investors to invest in spare parts and components for car assembly in Cambodia to reduce car prices significantly.
According to Soeun Dara, the use of new cars in Cambodia will increase by more than 50% in the first five months of 2022 compared to the first five months of 2021, and the use of new cars is much better as Cambodia operates. Both the economy and society will improve in 2022.
The use of new cars has increased through the leadership of the Royal Government of Samdech Techo Hun Sen with the right and effective, which makes people now have jobs, income and the country's economy is better.
He said that the current understanding of people about cars is smart, because when you need to buy a car, look at every company that sells new cars to compare each company's car and price.
Used cars Compared to new cars, used cars do not have the same quality assurance as new cars, because used cars are all imported cars and the source of the car is not clear. So the smart customer can know and understand which car is his best choice.
He said that the current car prices, compared to new cars and used cars, see that new cars and used cars have similar prices because the Royal Government has facilitated the import tax on new cars, so people can change from use. Used cars and used cars.
Currently, the Cambodian Automobile Industry Federation has 26 members who have the right to import cars into Cambodia, but the family car import brand is more than 50 brands, including Korean and Chinese cars.
