On that occasion, Dr. Koy Pisey urged the authorities in Prey Ampok commune to continue to provide better services to the people, especially to grasp the problems of the people and solve them quickly. Does not adhere to any political tendencies.
Dr. Koy Pisey also advised the authorities to increase internal unity together, to strive to increase the number of members in accordance with the recommendations of Samdech Techo Prime Minister on the principle of "keep the old, build new" even though. Currently, the Cambodian People's Party has won a lot, but do not forget to change the people.
