(Pursat): Phnom Kravanh District Administration, in collaboration with Cambodia Rehabilitation Organization, on the afternoon of June 24, 2022, organized a consultation forum on discussions and responses to local community concerns on land issues, natural management, and service delivery. Public and village, commune, and sangkat policies are safe for parents, people, and people from Kseth Borey village, Mal area, Reang Khvav area, and Che area, a total of 97 people.
