Director General of Agriculture tells farmers that fresh lentils can be exported to China only if they are of high quality and free of toxic chemicals
(Battambang): Mr. Ngin Chhay, Delegate of the Royal Government of Cambodia in charge of the Director General of the General Department of Agriculture, told the farmers that in order for Cambodia's fresh longan fruit to be exported to China, only high quality longan fruit without chemicals Toxic and accurate to technical standards.
Mr. Ngin Chhay made a statement at a seminar on phytosanitary requirements for the export of fresh longan from Cambodia to China on June 24, 2022 at the President Hotel, Battambang.
Mr. Ngin Chhay stated that under the wise leadership of the Royal Government of Cambodia, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries has instructed and recommended the Ministry of Agriculture to find markets for agricultural products. People regularly talk about all kinds of yields, especially now about fresh lentils.
Mr. Ngin Chhay confirmed to the community of fresh lentil plantation owners that the export of fresh lentils through the export company depends on the good lentil yield, which can be accepted by the packaging company, hygienic, decent and quality. By good standards.
Mr. Ke Monivuth, Director of the Department of Crop Protection, Sanitation and Hygiene of the General Department of Agriculture, has stated that as expected in the coming harvest season, in September 2022, Cambodia's fresh longan fruit will be able to export. Official to China after the protocol on phytosanitary requirements for the export of Cambodian fresh fruit to China was signed on March 16, 2022.
The King confirms that he received the information to change Samdech Techo's birthday and wished Samdech Techo success in his mission to serve the nation and the people.
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, has sent a message to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, confirming his receipt. Presentation on the change of the date of birth of Samdech.
