For Mr. Ros Sovacha, spokesman for the Ministry of Education and Youth, said that illegal drugs and alcohol can endanger the health and lives of students and stakeholders. The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has been working with all stakeholders to raise awareness of the effects of illicit drug and alcohol use.
He said the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports is cooperating with other partners to promote the impact and effective measures to reduce accidents caused by the illegal use of drugs and alcohol. Cambodia launches two collective rice brands to increase rice prices for farmers
Minister Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, said that the inauguration of these two collective brands is good for Cambodia to show the growth potential of the rice sector in Cambodia and readiness to compete in the international rice market.
The Minister congratulated and commended all the leaders and members of the Cambodian Rice Federation for achieving these two rice brands in addition to the already registered luxury rice brands. This proves that the development is another part of the development of the Cambodian rice sector from seed preparation to market.
At the same time, the Minister said that fragrant rice varieties have been playing an important role in exports, and this type of rice is a non-seasonal rice variety, which allows farmers to grow up to three times in A year at a time when the development of the irrigation system has been under construction. This fragrant rice variety is a new choice for farmers and exporters to compete with other countries' fragrant rice.
Oknha Hun Lak, Chairman of the Board of the Rice Federation of Cambodia, said that the establishment of a collective brand is the most important thing to build customer confidence and build a clear for farmers, because now some farmers face On the difficulty of selling their rice at harvest time due to cultivation, there is no clear source of market demand and exporters do not have specific information from farmers.
"The establishment of this rice brand will benefit us in the medium and long term, which requires us to work harder and reduce the information gap of market demand and production between you," said Hun Lak. "Export mills and farmers."
"Deum Veay Mongkul" is the first seed of rice that has been released and disseminated to farmers by the Agricultural Research and Development Institute of Cambodia of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries since the end of 2013. November 2, depending on the weather and planting time. 100 grains of rice weigh 3.4 grams and have an average yield of 3.2 tons per hectare.
Duke Hun Lak stated that exports increased by 21.73% compared to the same period in 2021, and he hopes and believes that through the new collective brand will help boost exports. More. According to the forecast of the Cambodian Rice Federation, exports in 2022 could reach around 70 to 750,000 tons, an increase of more than 100,000 tons compared to the same period in 2021.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, on June 23, 2022, sent a congratulatory message to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the occasion of the court's decision to correct his date of birth on April 4, 1951. Date of actual birth of Samdech on August 5, 1952.
