He said that the new document on internal control of information technology replaces the document on the management of internal control system of information technology released in 2016 and is believed to be more comprehensive to meet the needs of auditors, including the class. Lead and developer of information technology systems in the context of the rapid growth of digital public services today as well as in the future.
Mr. Steng Sokhom, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, encouraged all internal auditors to work in accordance with the legal framework, technical standards, internal audit skills and to strengthen their capacity on a regular basis to contribute to the provision of public services of the Ministry. Institutions and public entities have improved.
