(Phnom Penh): Mr. Kim Virak, Advisor and Director of the National Program of the National Committee for Disaster Management, called for the strengthening of solidarity and all-round cooperation to make the Asia-Pacific region more resilient and sustainable. Reduce loss of life and damage to the national and regional economy.
