Mr. Kim Virak strongly expressed his confidence that the three-day earthquake response exercise will make a significant contribution to achieving the goal of making the Asia-Pacific region more resilient and reduce life-threatening disasters. Life and damage to the national and regional economy. In particular, it will contribute to enhancing relations and partnerships between ASEAN Regional Forum member countries in the field of disaster management.
