(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, stated that the practice of Islam by the people of Cambodia is alive, especially after the genocidal regime and due to the support of the Royal Government.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng said that although the current cooperation with the Islamic World Alliance is not yet large, he expressed hope that in the future, the cooperation between the two sides will be further enhanced. More. "In Cambodia, the practice of Islam by the people is also very lively, especially after the genocidal regime and with the support of the Royal Government."
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also extended a warm welcome to the Secretary General of the Islamic World Alliance, as well as the delegation that visited Cambodia on this occasion and thanked the organization for its cooperation with Cambodia in the past and Furthermore, including Saudi Arabia, which has accepted Cambodian workers to work.
He also reminded that he had previously met with the Saudi Ambassador to Cambodia, during which the Ambassador invited him to visit to enhance cooperation between the Ministry of Interior of Cambodia and the Royal Government of Saudi Arabia. The prince welcomed and said that the delay in the visit was due to the situation of Kovid-19.
However, the prince said that now is the right time for both sides to increase cooperation, because from Cambodia, there are also Muslims and workers traveling to Saudi Arabia for religious and employment purposes, which protects security. They are also under the authority of the Ministry of Interior.
He also informed Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng that during this visit, he met with Cambodian Muslims, both groups of Samdech Preah Sangkareach and met with Samdech Techo Hun Sen. He said that although the percentage of Muslims in Cambodia is small, but they understand and live in harmony with other Muslims.
He also informed the Samdech that he had received a prestigious recommendation from Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the harmonization of religion in Cambodia and continued that this harmonious living is a proof that Cambodia is a rich country. Great culture and civilization that he will share to the international forum.
