Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of Celebrating the 45th Anniversary of the Journey to National Liberation Struggle
(Phnom Penh): On June 20, 2022, it is 45 years since Samdech Techo Hun Sen and four loyal comrades-in-arms took their lives as capital to go to Vietnam to seek support to fight Liberate the nation and the people of Cambodia from the brutal genocidal regime of Khmer Pol Pot and his cronies.
Cambodia and Vietnam jointly hold a solemn ceremony to celebrate and commemorate the brave struggle for national liberation and the people of Cambodia 45 years ago. The ceremony was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Pham Minh Chinh, Prime Minister of Vietnam, at the Cambodia-Vietnam border, Area X16, in Tonlong Commune, Memot District, Tbong Khmum Province, where Samdech Techo and his comrades crossed into Vietnam in the middle of the night. 45 years ago.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Prime Minister of Vietnam for allowing him to go to the incense burner and thanked the Vietnamese people who helped Samdech 45 years ago.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if I did not act 45 years ago, I would surely die. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech had four choices 45 years ago, but finally chose the second option
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when receiving assistance from Vietnam, the Vietnamese army outnumbered Cambodia and the Vietnamese army was at war with Pol Pot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded to go to Vietnam by choosing 5 people without bringing the whole army
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sheds tears as he recalls the struggle to enter Vietnam to seek help
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the most difficult thing is to write a letter to Samdech Kittipritthbandit 45 years ago because he could not reveal his location
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that Vietnam's act of coming to the rescue of the Cambodian people 45 years ago was justified by a trial by a UN-recognized hybrid court
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnam has now achieved justice with the CPP through the success of the Khmer Rouge trial.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnam did not withdraw its troops from Cambodia after the Paris Agreement, but Vietnam withdrew its troops completely on September 30, 1989.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who said that because of the Paris Agreement, Vietnam withdrew its troops was a misrepresentation of the actual situation
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnamese experts were withdrawn from Cambodia one year before the withdrawal of troops and Vietnam withdrew troops from Cambodia two years before the Paris Agreement
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for the past 45 years the situation has changed, but Hun Sen's character has not changed
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen declared that I have no right to hand over a millimeter of land to Vietnam and do not want even a millimeter of Vietnamese land, let it be resolved correctly according to the French map.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his goal is to transform the Cambodia-Vietnam border area into a zone of peace and development
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested to make it easier for Cambodians and Vietnamese to visit each other in the historical area X16 without using a passport
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a meal that the Vietnamese people gave him when he entered Vietnam 45 years ago was worth more than the tens of thousands of tons of rice that Cambodia now has. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the development of Cambodia now is not an exclusive achievement of Samdech
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we have won the war in Dalta, Alpha and Omikrong, but have not yet completely won the 19 Kovid War
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia has to be vaccinated in the 20th dose, the Royal Government does not take money from the people for vaccination
