Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie Commander Brigadier General So Savoeun told Fresh News on June 19, 2022 that on June 16, the Kampong Siem District Gendarmerie received a complaint from the victims. Six people said that an unidentified suspect stole a total of 08 mobile phones belonging to them at the wedding venue in Thmor Koul village, Ro Ang commune, Kampong Siem district, Kampong Cham province.
