The police confiscated 8 mobile phones belonging to the victim, and a black 2013 C125 motorcycle with license plate Phnom Penh 1AC-0094 as a means of action. After interrogation, the three suspects confessed that they had indeed stolen the victim's phone and had stolen the cell phone six times in the past. Already in the geography of Kampong Cham.
