(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, on June 16, 2022, issued a directive on the preparation of the Royal Birthday Ceremony of Her Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, Queen Mother of Cambodia. Freedom, dignity and happiness at the age of 86. This is according to the instructions received by Fresh News on June 16, 2022.
1: The Office of the Ministry of Interior and the non-office units of the Ministry of Interior shall prepare the signature of His Majesty the Queen Mother of Cambodia as a high place of worship, decorated with colored lights, slogans, blessing messages and Raise national flags, religious flags, royal flags, banners, congratulatory slogans.
3. The Capital and Provincial Administration shall organize a program to visit the patients who are being treated at the referral hospital, and must implement strict medical measures, such as wearing a mask, washing their hands with soap and alcohol, and maintaining a safe distance.
4: To increase security measures and public order strictly in the areas of celebration and entertainment of the people, such as: pagodas, temples, monuments, resorts, tourist destinations to maintain good order and arrange fireworks. On the night of June 18, 2022 to celebrate this great day.
5. Strengthen cooperation with relevant authorities to prevent and control the spread of Kovid-19 by consistently implementing 3 measures to prevent 3 in pagodas, towns and public places.
6: Prevent and crack down on all activities that lead to danger, cause fear to the people and will lead to adverse effects on the honor and dignity of the society, such as: gangsterism, violence, use of weapons, explosives, ammunition. And gambling of all kinds.
7. Promote the enforcement of land traffic laws and plan in advance to organize traffic order on national roads, towns, such as various destinations where people gather to organize order, reduce congestion and accidents. That could happen eventually.
8. To pay attention to educating the people to be vigilant about fires and disasters by organizing forces and means to be ready 24 hours a day to cooperate in rescuing in case of fire and natural disasters that occur eventually.
9: To strengthen the work at all levels and be ready to intervene in the event of an accident and to cooperate with major media to provide timely information such as traffic congestion to make people aware in advance to turn the direction Traffic. At the same time, subordinates must be prepared to change their regular shifts.
According to the draft Financial Law for 2023, inflation will slow to around 2.5% by 2023 due to the expectation of a return to normal prices of oil and other commodities. Others, as well as economic activity.
