According to a report by the Ministry of Agriculture, in the first five months of this year, total agricultural exports to international markets amounted to more than 4.6 million tons to 60 countries, an increase of more than 420,000 tons or 10.24 tons. % Compared to the same period in 2021, which was just over 4.1 million tons.
Despite the increase in exports, the Ministry observed that some fresh agricultural exports have recently declined significantly, especially exports to China.
