In conclusion, what politicians need to do next, no matter what political party you belong to, must unite and work together in harmony, serving the people with the utmost sincerity under the leadership of the Royal Government of Cambodia to maintain peace. And continue to develop the country to grow further in return for the gratitude of the people who own the vote.
