(Battambang): The Battambang Provincial Administration celebrated the 5th National Day of Technical and Vocational Education and Training on the morning of June 15, 2022 under the chairmanship of Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Battambang Province. The 5th National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day was organized under the theme TVET to increase labor productivity and high competition, which was also held at Neak Banh Teuk Park, Battambang.
