On that occasion, he stated that the celebration of this day aims to promote technical and vocational education and dissemination to students, youth, parents, guardians, the public to understand the importance of technical and vocational education in Promoting the development of a skilled and efficient workforce to meet the needs of the domestic and foreign labor market.
