The following is the full text of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's message: This morning, the World Cup arrived in Cambodia, and Samdech Techo Hun Sen received the trophy in person.
The National Olympic Committee of Cambodia said that the World Cup, which is made of pure gold and weighs more than 6 kilograms, will be transported by private jet. The arrival of the $ 20 million World Cup comes under the World Cup tour program to celebrate the December 2022 World Cup in Doha, Qatar.
The National Olympic Committee of Cambodia (NOCC) emphasized that the arrival of the World Cup today was the first appearance on Cambodian soil since the trophy was established in 1974.
According to the National Olympic Committee of Cambodia, Cambodia will host a number of events to welcome the World Cup. The event included: an award parade from Phnom Penh International Airport to the Peace Palace, a reception and a world award ceremony under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Peace Palace.
The National Olympic Committee of Cambodia will also host a reception and photo shoot with the World Cup at the Moradok Techo National Stadium from about 1pm to 10pm, accompanied by live music.
The National Olympic Committee of Cambodia calls on the people and youth of football lovers to join in the congratulations and national pride with sincerity for another new historical event for Cambodia.
But what is important is to bring this trophy to Cambodia because the World Football Federation looks at the security, order and safety of Cambodia. But this trophy has been stolen and lost twice. The first was in 1966 in England and the second in 1983 in Brazil. But for Cambodia to have peace, security and good security, the World Football Federation decided to bring this trophy to Cambodia in history.
Mr. Vath Chamroeun also said that bringing the World Cup to Cambodia safely and securely, it will help Cambodia have a good reputation to host the SEA Games and reach tens of thousands of international guests. People in 2023 are warm and worry-free.
