1: The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training is responsible for organizing this National Day by properly implementing health measures. At the same time, it is necessary to produce videos and other documents in collaboration with relevant ministries, institutions, administrations, capitals, provinces, national and international organizations, development partners and the private sector to disseminate widely throughout the country.
