Russian Ambassador to Cambodia Congratulates Russia on "National Day June 12" and Intends to Strengthen Cooperation with Cambodia and ASEAN
(Phnom Penh): On June 12, the Russian Federation always celebrates an important national day, the National Day of Russia, while in 2022 is the 350th anniversary. This is according to the congratulatory message of Mr. Anatoly Borovic, Ambassador of the Russian Federation to Cambodia with the intention of strengthening cooperation with Cambodia and ASEAN.
On this glorious occasion, Mr. Anatoly Borovic warmly congratulated the people of Russia and friends in Cambodia. Today is a symbol of remembrance of the great works of Russian ancestors, as well as giving the Russian people the opportunity to revisit their recent achievements and revise plans for the future.
