Speaking at the graduation ceremony for more than 2,000 students of the Royal School of Administration on June 13, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that through the message he sent to the provincial governor around the Tonle Sap Lake, the governor Relevant people in their respective provinces must be responsible for clearing land in three areas for people living from 10 years up.
Samdech Techo suggested that if possible, the forest area where the people live should be organized into community forest so that the people can take care of the forest and find non-family fishery products there. The relevant authorities must also call for him not to cut down the forest, but also to give him the forest to maintain and use as a community forest.
Samdech Techo continued that some 2 areas can be cut into 1 area, 3 areas can be cut into 2 areas, but some 3 areas where people live are not close to 2 areas, so it must be cut so that people do not People are worried that in the future he will be evacuated.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister further instructed the governors around the six Tonle Sap Lake:
First, the land confiscated from the people recently planted trees and must continue to be planted and protected. Second: Prevent further encroachment. At this point, the national level has given power to the provincial level and it is not possible for the provincial administration to turn to the Minister of Agriculture, the Minister of Water Resources, the Minister of Environment or the Minister of Land Management. Regulation of everything.
