Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occupation of Graduation Ceremony for More Than 2,000 Students of the Royal School of Administration
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of June 13, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, distributed diplomas to more than 2,000 students of the Royal School of Administration after their successful graduation. The students of the Royal School of Administration who graduated as officials and received a degree under the presidency of Samdech Techo today include: 2,388 students, trainees and trainees.
On the occasion of handing out diplomas to more than 2,000 students of the Royal School of Administration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for nearly 2 hours and 30 minutes, the following are the main contents:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that due to the outbreak of Kovid 19, it failed to organize the graduation program for students of the Royal School of Administration in 2021.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has now overcome Kovid 19 and allowed the program to be reorganized in a new way.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates and appreciates the students of the Royal School of Administration who have successfully graduated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although the Kovid 19 disease had spread to Cambodia, it did not disrupt Cambodia's education. School leaders, faculty and students work together to overcome educational difficulties.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the best reform starts from training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all ministries and institutions can function well, requiring the necessary human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that now and for many years to come, Kovid 19 will still be a complex issue for society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the fight against Kovid 19 is not a simple thing, everyone has worked very hard to fight Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the measures taken by the Royal Government to fight Kovid 19 are for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the Ambassador of the European Union that for Europe to prioritize, it is not known, but for Cambodia to prioritize the right to life and study.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to win the Battle of Kovid 19, Cambodia had mobilized all its forces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vaccination against Kovid 19 in Cambodia is not politically motivated. That is, all political tendencies have been vaccinated against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people do not care about any political party or religion, what he cares about is protecting the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen exposed the hypocritical hypocrisy of the opposition on vaccination policy. First, people are not allowed to get vaccinated, then they are being pushed to get vaccinated when Cambodia is short of vaccines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the poisonous plot of the opposition group on vaccination failed because of the art of solving the problem of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the policy of devolving power to the sub-national level contributed to Cambodia being able to control and win the Battle of Kovid 19.
* Starting from the experience of fighting against Kovid 19, Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages ministries and institutions to transfer power to sub-national officials.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the leadership stage of Samdech and many other national dignitaries left a lot of legacy for the next generation.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the EU Ambassador that the opposition had insulted him.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that one should value the vaccination against Kovid 19 in Cambodia, which has no political affiliation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to continue to receive 19 doses of Kovid vaccine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that the people must unite against the global economic crisis caused by Kovid 19 and the Russia-Ukraine war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for curbing inflation and promoting the use of the riel to counter the global economic crisis.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the food crisis will become a global crisis in the future.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there will be an increase in the salaries of civil servants in 2022 after a two-year absence. In that, those who are paid less increase more, those who are paid more increase less.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked more than 80 percent of the registered voters who went to the polls on June 5.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for exercising their right to choose their preferred leader.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked the Security Management Committee during the election for maintaining security and order.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked and congratulated the National Election Committee for organizing the election process well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people who voted for the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people's election for the Cambodian People's Party is an election for peace and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the loss of some seats to the opposition was just a normal part of the democratic process.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that winning more than 90% of commune / sangkat chief seats and more than 80% of commune / sangkat councils is enough for the CPP.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech does not care about commune / sangkat councils from any political party, but must work together. Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on the election process not to be divided.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that officials must constantly remind themselves that they are the servants of the people, not the masters of the people, and their goal is to serve the people faithfully.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to accomplish a task, three steps must be taken, including: planning, assigning and resolving any random factors that appear during implementation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the emergence of random factors in the implementation of the plan will make two officials appear: good officials try to solve problems and bad officials can only blame the lower level and report.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on July 16 and 17, the CPP will hold an extraordinary meeting.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the authorities for their hard work during the 19-Kovid crisis without waiting for orders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds officials to absolutely avoid the position of pumpkin seed officer. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that patriots are not based on words, but on practical actions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that officials of the first type of pumpkin should be trampled by elephants and officials of the fourth type of pumpkin should be encouraged.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech and the Prime Minister of Vietnam will celebrate the 45th anniversary of the national liberation struggle on the Cambodian-Vietnamese border on June 20.
* The Prime Minister of Laos called Samdech Techo while speaking on the forum.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech will be ready to ask a person involved in the past, saying that hundreds of people were arrested during the 19 crisis.
