Later, at around 4:00 pm, a customer bought a 70-centimeter-long samurai sword from the suspect for $ 50, and at 5:00 a.m. on the same day, the suspect took it. A 70-centimeter-long samurai sword was handed over to the customer at the scene, and the police arrested and confiscated a 70-centimeter-long samurai sword.
Mr. Bun Satya continued that after searching the room of the above suspects, the specialized police force found 191 more samurai swords and took the swords and the above suspects to the light criminal police office. Of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for further questioning.
The above suspects are named Tiv Chhunty, 24 years old, Occupation: Salesman, Living in rented house No. 370, Room No. 107, Street No. 67, Bette, Tnot Chrum 2 Village, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 2, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh. The exhibits confiscated by the specialized police force included: 191 samurai swords.
After presenting the suspects together with the above exhibits, the specialized police force sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to proceed with the legal procedure.
Mr. Thong Khon held a meeting to review the party's work in Baray and Tang Kork districts after the commune election and put forward a plan for further local development.
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Thong Khon, Deputy Chairman of the Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party in Kampong Thom Province and Chairman of the Working Group to Assist Baray and Taing Kork Districts on June 11, 2022, chaired a meeting to review the party's work in Baray district (in the morning) and in Taing Kork district (in the afternoon) after the Commune / Sangkat Council elections of the 5th mandate have passed, as well as to submit a plan to help the commune / village.
After the above report, Mr. Thong Khon summarized and evaluated the above work and set out some action plans.
He advised the parties at all levels in the two districts to strengthen the gaps in each village / commune, such as strengthening the structure of the party at all levels to be ready to continue to win. National Assembly election in 2023.
He added that the youth is also an important party support force, so pay attention to building more party youth forces, and party youth must also actively participate with the party to build a strong force at its base.
He told them to continue to build and expand party members in 10 communes in Baray district and 8 communes in Taing Kork district by regularly visiting backyards in villages and helping to solve their problems. Organizing public forums is also important to attract party support. The purpose of this public forum is to listen to and address the requests of the people.
Mr. Thong Khon emphasized that all the promises made to the people before the last commune / sangkat election must be fulfilled to fulfill the people, such as the construction of roads, canals, irrigation systems, bridges, drains and continue to promote the implementation of land policy. Original.
