Kandal Steung district is a district in Kandal province that received the majority of votes from the people in this 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election.
Kandal Stung district has 18 communes and a total of 72,235 registered voters. According to preliminary results released by the National Election Committee, Kandal Stung district has a total of 64,827 people, or 89.74 percent of the registered population.
The results showed that 52,360 people, or 82.61 percent, voted in favor of the CPP. Through this vote, the CPP controls all nine commune council seats. Separately, in the other 9 communes, the Candlelight Party received 1 seat per commune.
