On behalf of General Hing Bun Heang and all Kandal Stung District Assistance Team, Duke Try Pheap expressed his deepest gratitude to the people who voted for the CPP, providing opportunities and trust. Commune councils from the Cambodian People's Party to continue to lead in all communes in Kandal Stung district.
As a facilitator in the construction and development of Kandal Stung district, Duke Try Pheap expressed his commitment to participate in the development of Kandal Stung district, infrastructure to meet the needs of the people and make people's lives better. Excellence.
Duke Try Pheap also called on the working group of the Cambodian People's Party in Kandal Steung district to continue to work hard to strengthen the unity within the party and to act more jointly towards the 2023 National Assembly election.
