(Phnom Penh): Dr. Hang Chuon Narong, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, participated in the signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding between the Thak Global Institute and the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports to enhance technological capabilities and the growth of the digital economy. The ceremony was held at the Ministry of Education.
Collaboration between the Ministry of Education and the Thak Global Institute includes: Internships of Thak Global Institute students, Thak Global Institute Scholarships through various ministries' social networks, and future collaborations that enhance capacity building. Technology, technology solutions and the growth of the digital economy.
