Thak Global Institute was established in 2019 with the full support of a group of Japanese businessmen and managed by a group of young Cambodian intellectuals. There is also support and guidance from senior individuals of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, as well as the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation.
There are two types of partners of Thak Global Institute, the first type is public and private institutions that focus on internships, job opportunities for students, partners in technology, ecological partnerships and sustainable partnerships. Another type of collaboration is educational institutions that focus on joint diplomas, joint curriculum development, and general cooperation.
