Mr. Long Naro claimed that now for areas that used to have water shortages, such as in Chhouk Va 2 and Kambol areas, there is no longer a problem. This April 2022, before the Khmer New Year, as promised.
He added that for the master plan of the Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority, from year to year, there should be no shortage of water to supply the people. He added that the master plan covers an area of 670 square kilometers and also includes the new airport area and the Noble King area, while currently the service area can be supplied about 83-85 percent.
