He added that based on the forecast of water demand in 2030, which will be able to reach about 1.8 million cubic meters per day, which is why the Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority has set a goal to expand production capacity and Distribute clean water to supply water in Phnom Penh and Takhmao until 2030.
