Heavy rain and wind hit some areas in Pursat city, Kandeang and Bakan districts of Pursat province, destroying nearly 40 houses and damaging a large number of equipment
(Pursat): Natural disasters, rain and strong winds hit some areas in Pursat city, Kandeang and Bakan districts of Pursat province on the evening of June 08, 2022, destroying nearly 40 houses and damaging some equipment. But does not endanger human life.
