The source said that at 2:25 a.m. on the same day, in some areas in Kandeang district, there was a natural disaster of rain and wind, causing initial damage to 23 houses and damage to some equipment.
The source added that at 04:50 on the same day, in some areas in Kandeang district, there was also a natural disaster of rain and wind, which caused damage to the first 5 houses and damaged some equipment. Well.
