* The Kingdom of Cambodia has always adhered to the policy of permanent neutrality and non-alignment. The Kingdom of Cambodia coexists peacefully with its neighbors and all other countries in the world.
* The Kingdom of Cambodia does not invade any country, does not interfere in the internal affairs of other countries directly or indirectly, in any form, resolves all issues peacefully and respects each other's interests.
The Kingdom of Cambodia does not form military alliances or enter into any military agreements that are inconsistent with its neutrality.
The Kingdom of Cambodia does not allow foreign military bases on its territory and also does not allow its military bases abroad, except within the framework of the United Nations request.
