* Third mandate: The third mandate Commune / Sangkat Council election held in 2012 had 10 political parties contesting, but only 6 political parties won a total of 11,459 seats.
The seats of the political parties that won the Commune / Sangkat Council elections of the second mandate include: - 8,292 seats of the Cambodian People's Party - 2,155 seats of the Sam Rainsy Party - 151 seats of FUNCINPEC Party - Norodom Ranariddh Party 52 seats - Human Rights Party 800 seats - Democratic Party 8 seats - Cambodian Nationality Party 1 seat
