Senior Minister Ly Thuch on behalf of Samdech Techo Congratulates the 96th Birthday Celebration of Princess Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom
(Phnom Penh) Senior Minister Ly Thuch, First Deputy Chairman of the Mine Authority, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the evening of June 2, 2022, was the guest of honor at the Royal Birthday Celebration. 96 The age of Princess Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom.
On behalf of the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia, the Senior Minister congratulated Queen Elizabeth II and the people of the United Kingdom on the occasion of the birthday of the Queen of the United Kingdom and Northern Ireland.
On that occasion, the Senior Minister expressed his congratulations and blessings on Queen Elizabeth II, wishing her good health, long life and glorious reign, and wishing the people of the United Kingdom good health. Abundance of peace, prosperity and happiness.
"Queen Elizabeth's lifelong leadership and dedication is an example for all nations," he said. Under his rule, Britain overcame many major obstacles and achieved harmony in lasting stability. The strong bond between our two peoples is a powerful light that illuminates our path to a beautiful world full of love, peace and prosperity.
He added that the two countries have supported each other in international forums and maintained high-level exchanges on bilateral economic and trade issues, which remained stable even during the 19-Kovid crisis. The Royal Government and the people of Cambodia would like to thank the Government for its continued provision of GDP concessions to promote free and fair trade with Cambodia.
This stronger cooperation was strengthened by the strong presence of the UK Business and Investment through the UK Trade and Investment Office in Phnom Penh, established in January 2013.
On behalf of the Royal Government, the Senior Minister strongly hopes that this office will continue to work closely with the relevant authorities of Cambodia to take our bilateral trade and investment to a new level. Ieng Vandy Leads CPP Members and Supporters in Closing Campaign in Sre Russey Commune, Thala Parivat District
