(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Kun Kim, Permanent Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Field Team, this Friday morning, June 3, 2022, led thousands of members, youth and activists supporting the Cambodian People's Party. People close the election campaign in Oddar Meanchey province.
The closing ceremony of the election campaign in Oddar Meanchey province, the last Khmer Rouge stronghold, was celebrated with a standing ovation. After listening to Mr. Kun Kim's speeches and instructions, the party working groups in the 24 districts, municipalities and communes / sangkats in the province shouted propaganda and political messages to attract and seek support from Citizens own the vote.
