In that, Mr. Kun Kim pointed out that Oddar Meanchey province is a border area far from Phnom Penh, especially the territory that found the last peace after the Khmer Rouge leader surrendered to the Royal Government on December 29, 1998.
The Permanent Member of the Cambodian People's Party emphasized that although Oddar Meanchey is the last peaceful territory, the last developed territory, but under the policy of turning the former battlefield into a development and commercial area. The actions of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, have made Oddar Meanchey province prosperous in all areas.
"Our Oddar Meanchey territory is no different from other provinces across Cambodia, even though our province is the last to end the war," he said. Under the leadership of Samdech Techo, we have made progress in all areas, including infrastructure, roads, bridges, education, public health, water, electricity, agriculture, which contributes to improving the lives of people. This is the confirmation of Mr. Kun Kim.
In addition to highlighting the great achievements of the nation in the past, Mr. Kun Kim also highlighted the recent great achievements under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in protecting the health of the people. Citizens from the 19 epidemics of Kovid by finding vaccines to vaccinate people in a timely manner and led to a national and international evaluation and shock.
Mr. Kun Kim called on the people to go to the polls on Sunday, June 5, 2022, to vote for the Cambodian People's Party with the logo of "Tevata Bach Pka" to give the opportunity for the CPP Commune / Sangkat Chief to serve. People build, develop communes / sangkats to be more prosperous and make people's lives better.
As the leader of the Cambodian People's Party and the Chairman of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Working Group, Mr. Kun Kim announced his commitment and commitment that he will continue to pay attention and encourage the commune chiefs from the Cambodian People's Party. Take care to provide services and serve the people. Mr. Kun Kim also committed to contribute to the construction and development of provinces and communes / Sangkats to improve and improve the lives of people.
