* Political parties and / or candidates must not mobilize forces from any provincial capital to act in other capitals or provinces with the intention of causing social unrest and disruption in order to disrupt the election campaign and the election.
* Political parties and / or candidates and citizens must participate in safeguarding the security environment for the election campaign and the election well, without taking any action that is contrary to the principles of the election law, regulations and procedures of Electoral code of conduct for political parties and candidates in the election process and other relevant legal documents in force.
